  "description": "The Technical Team Online Assessment is designed to evaluate participants' problem-solving ability, programming knowledge, and fundamental technical concepts. Assessment Format Duration: 90 minutes Total Marks: 100 Total Questions: 9 Sections: Section A – Coding (50 Marks) 2 Programming Questions Topics include Arrays, Sliding Window, and Monotonic Stack. Section B – Web Development (20 Marks) 2 Multiple Choice Questions Topics include HTTP, REST APIs, and CORS. Section C – C++ (30 Marks) 5 Multiple Choice Questions Topics include Pointers, References, OOP, Polymorphism, and STL. Rules: Participants must complete the assessment within the given time limit. Read all questions and constraints carefully before submitting. Efficient solutions are expected for programming questions. Participants should ensure that their submissions are final before the assessment ends.",
