    "details": "<p>The Technical Team Online Assessment is designed to evaluate participants' problem-solving ability, programming knowledge, and fundamental technical concepts.</p>\n<p><strong>Assessment Format</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"439\">\n<li data-section-id=\"yllr3s\" data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"391\"><strong data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"380\">Duration:</strong> 90 minutes</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1vteqsn\" data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"414\"><strong data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"410\">Total Marks:</strong> 100</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"185pgqc\" data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"439\"><strong data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"437\">Total Questions:</strong> 9</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Sections:</strong></p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"488\">Section A &ndash; Coding (50 Marks)</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"576\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1a5juu6\" data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"514\">2 Programming Questions</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"uztomd\" data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"576\">Topics include Arrays, Sliding Window, and Monotonic Stack.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"620\">Section B &ndash; Web Development (20 Marks)</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"694\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1ywsny4\" data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"650\">2 Multiple Choice Questions</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"lq1ilp\" data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"694\">Topics include HTTP, REST APIs, and CORS.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"726\">Section C &ndash; C++ (30 Marks)</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"823\">\n<li data-section-id=\"i0ovej\" data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"756\">5 Multiple Choice Questions</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1kwm0ot\" data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"823\">Topics include Pointers, References, OOP, Polymorphism, and STL.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rules:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"1125\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1ckaunw\" data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"907\">Participants must complete the assessment within the given time limit.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ya8rzn\" data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"973\">Read all questions and constraints carefully before submitting.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"yqv0pu\" data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1035\">Efficient solutions are expected for programming questions.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"b87pix\" data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1125\">Participants should ensure that their submissions are final before the assessment ends.</li>\n</ul>",
